::GEO_U02_L04_Q01::
Question ID:<br>GEO_U02_L04_Q01<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>MLA.GEO.CGM.5<br><br>Question:<br>Point A(1, 4) is translated by (x, y) -> (x + 2, y - 3). What is A prime? {
= (3, 1)#Correct. This applies the transformation rule in the required order and gives the image coordinate.
~ (-1, 7)#This choice applies the wrong sign, direction, or sequence step. Recheck the coordinate rule and transform each vertex in order.
~ (3, 7)#This choice applies the wrong sign, direction, or sequence step. Recheck the coordinate rule and transform each vertex in order.
~ (1, 1)#This choice applies the wrong sign, direction, or sequence step. Recheck the coordinate rule and transform each vertex in order.
}

