::GEO_U02_L04_Q11::
Question ID:<br>GEO_U02_L04_Q11<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>MLA.GEO.CGM.5<br><br>Question:<br>Which rule reflects a figure across the y-axis? {
~ (x, y) -> (x, -y)#This choice applies the wrong sign, direction, or sequence step. Recheck the coordinate rule and transform each vertex in order.
~ (x, y) -> (y, x)#This choice applies the wrong sign, direction, or sequence step. Recheck the coordinate rule and transform each vertex in order.
