~ (x, y) -> (-y, x)#This choice applies the wrong sign, direction, or sequence step. Recheck the coordinate rule and transform each vertex in order.
}

::GEO_U02_L04_Q12::
Question ID:<br>GEO_U02_L04_Q12<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>MLA.GEO.CGM.5<br><br>Question:<br>Which rule rotates a figure 90 degrees clockwise about the origin? {
