~ Side lengths are never important#This choice applies the wrong sign, direction, or sequence step. Recheck the coordinate rule and transform each vertex in order.
~ The coordinate plane requires four points#This choice applies the wrong sign, direction, or sequence step. Recheck the coordinate rule and transform each vertex in order.
}

