::GEO_U02_L04_Q19::
Question ID:<br>GEO_U02_L04_Q19<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>MLA.GEO.CGM.5<br><br>Question:<br>A point moves from (4, 4) to (-4, 4), then to (-1, 4). Which sequence matches? {
