Question ID:<br>GEO_U02_L04_Q24<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>MLA.GEO.CGM.5<br><br>Question:<br>Point Q(3, -1) is reflected across the y-axis and then translated 4 units down. What is Q double prime? {
