}

::GEO_U02_L04_Q25::
Question ID:<br>GEO_U02_L04_Q25<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>MLA.GEO.CGM.5<br><br>Question:<br>Which answer best describes how to check a final transformed image? {
= Compare each final vertex to the rule and sequence order#Correct. This applies the transformation rule in the required order and gives the image coordinate.
~ Check only whether the drawing looks neat#This choice applies the wrong sign, direction, or sequence step. Recheck the coordinate rule and transform each vertex in order.
~ Use only the first vertex#This choice applies the wrong sign, direction, or sequence step. Recheck the coordinate rule and transform each vertex in order.
~ Ignore labels because the shape is enough#This choice applies the wrong sign, direction, or sequence step. Recheck the coordinate rule and transform each vertex in order.
}


